<p>BORROWER ARIZONA PUBLIC SERVICE</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.639  FIRST PAY DATE 05/15/1997</p>
